meta {
  name: 3 payment fails
  seq: 3
}

docs {
  Attendee places an order that exceeds the baseline hold, creating an overage
  hold (402). That overage is never confirmed; a payment_failed webhook marks it
  FAILED and reopens the tab. Organizer checkout skips the tab because the
  failed overage order still has non-cancelled items that are not ready.
}
